/Cargo.lock.wry

# Submodule working trees.
#
# Upstream tracks these as gitlinks (mode 160000). This fork was imported from a
# source archive, so no gitlinks were ever recorded — and committing the trees
# themselves would bury ~100MB of third-party code in the history.
# Restore them with `bash scripts/bootstrap-submodules.sh`; CI does the same.
/packages/foliate-js/
/packages/tauri/
/packages/simplecc-wasm/
/packages/qcms/
/packages/js-mdict/
/apps/readest-app/src-tauri/plugins/tauri-plugin-turso/
/apps/readest-app/src-tauri/plugins/tauri-plugin-webview-upgrade/
/apps/readest-app/.claude/skills/gstack/
